ze:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;For you to finally choose the right place for your wedding, you and your wife to be should sit down and discuss your options. Your wedding is one of the most important days of your life. You need to do your best in finding the right place and the right theme. Another thing that you need to be prepared with regards to wedding is your budget. The place that you will be choosing should fit the budget that you have. That&#039;s why an early preparation could be helpful because you will have enough time to prepare yourself and all the things that you need for your wedding. This will also allow you to think of all your options when it comes to destination wedding ideas.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896737,"PostDate":1432174494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">For you to finally choose the right place for your wedding, you and your wife to be should sit down and discuss your options. Your wedding is one of the most important days of your life. You need to do your best in finding the right place and the right theme. Another thing that you need to be prepared with regards to wedding is your budget. The place that you will be choosing should fit the budget that you have. That's why an early preparation could be helpful because you will have enough time to prepare yourself and all the things that you need for your wedding. This will also allow you to think of all your options when it comes to destination wedding ideas.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425082717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d72ac8deda803aa969b4b6acd08d309","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Hi girls!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Like some of you already mentioned, Mexico is a great option thay you might want to consider for a destination wedding since it adds a lot of flavor, great food, accommodating staff, etcetera.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Puerto Vallarta is a popular city known for its small-town feeling along with beautiful natural scenery. We host our weddings on a private beach at the south of Puerto Vallarta, where guests arrive only by boat (so talk about a vacation experience for your wedding!)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;If you want to find out more about our packages feel free to go to our website&amp;nbsp;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com &amp;nbsp;where you will be able to see more about Las Caletas, a beautiful and exotic beach location, perfect for a destination Wedding, with the support of our great wedding coordinators staff.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Best of luck finding the perfect venue!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79107]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81801]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81814]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp;\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(97,165,185);font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\"&gt;Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152&lt;\/span&gt;\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AdventureWedding&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:1pt;\"&gt;VAD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pintere