{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.66.62.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77989,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09fad8a856b7b3f7a819f8116b8c49a3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\" post=\"1888129\" timestamp=\"1425392037\"]\n@[member=\"emagana\"] How has the planning process been so far?[\/quote]\n\nIts been okay since I haven&#039;t really done to much planning.  Just finished designing save the dates and invitations.  Now I have to figure out the packages and add ons.    What about you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1888633,"PostDate":1425668456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrandMrsBonitto2016, on 03 March 2015 - 09:13 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"257344\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/257344-emagana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">emagana<\/span><\/a> How has the planning process been so far?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Its been okay since I haven't really done to much planning. \u00a0Just finished designing save the dates and invitations. \u00a0Now I have to figure out the packages and add ons. \u00a0 \u00a0What about you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"myterp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.246.208.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341176195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257344.jpg?_r=1429844920","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emagana","Id":257344,"Name":"emagana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77989,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ee6b9f48dcfeaadaf3de1df9c27108a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"emagana\" post=\"1888633\" timestamp=\"1425686456\"]\nIts been okay since I haven&#039;t really done to much planning.  Just finished designing save the dates and invitations.  Now I have to figure out the packages and add ons.    What about you?[\/quote]I&#039;m pretty much in the same stage as you. However, I think I&#039;m going to go with Kukua instead.","Attachments":[],"Id":1888960,"PostDate":1426060899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>emagana, on 06 March 2015 - 07:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Its been okay since I haven't really done to much planning. \u00a0Just finished designing save the dates and invitations. \u00a0Now I have to figure out the packages and add ons. \u00a0 \u00a0What about you?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm pretty much in the same stage as you. However, I think I'm going to go with Kukua instead.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394115176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.66.62.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77989,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"251f48dd4e7db71476d5a74a400162c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;May 2016 brides have your guest already started booking their stay? &amp;nbsp;I am just freaking out because some of our guest have started and they said some of the major travel sites are saying the resort has no more rooms. &amp;nbsp; :unsure:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904250,"PostDate":1441558549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>May 2016 brides have your guest already started booking their stay? \u00a0I am just freaking out because some of our guest have started and they said some of the major travel sites are saying the resort has no more rooms. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"myterp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.246.208.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341176195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257344.jpg?_r=1429844920","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emagana","Id":257344,"Name":"emagana","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
