venues outside hotels.[\/quote]Good night girls.. congrats on your engagement.. just wondering if you could send me the information regarding the Huracan? I am considering having my wedding there next year, but i cant find that much information online.. if any of you past brides can share anything about your day, that would be great..  Also, could you please email me any information or quotes at iviyanicar@hotmail.com \/ carmona.ivana@yahoo.com. Thanks ladies :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1850021,"PostDate":1399935933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Julia Eskin, on 23 March 2014 - 11:33 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Feel free to e-mail me at julia@juliaeskin.com and I can send you contact info for a wedding planner who deals with Huracan Cafe and other venues outside hotels.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Good night girls.. congrats on your engagement.. just wondering if you could send me the information regarding the Huracan? I am considering having my wedding there next year, but i cant find that much information online.. if any of you past brides can share anything about your day, that would be great.. \u00a0Also, could you please email me any information or quotes at iviyanicar@hotmail.com \/ carmona.ivana@yahoo.com. Thanks ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iviyanicar@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.94.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396561960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"anavy","Id":277473,"Name":"anavy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.1.48.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f353c7ddb24eb880e03d2304c0f4507","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Pao1\" post=\"1848096\" timestamp=\"1399129624\"]\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]Hi Ladies, [\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. [\/font][\/quote]\nHi! If possible, could you please send me the information? I would be greatly appreciated. [email=\"moniquenbooth@&amp;#91\"].com\"]moniquenbooth@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email]","Attachments":[],"Id":1851222,"PostDate":1400511490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pao1, on 03 May 2014 - 10:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Hi Ladies, <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi! If possible, could you please send me the information? I would be greatly appreciated. <a href='mailto:moniquenbooth@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>moniquenbooth@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"booth_monique@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.1.48.108","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382457701,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274467.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimi11758","Id":274467,"Name":"mimi11758","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.254.246.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cc303e9a9f38fb3c5126b5ce2ba2154","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Pao1\" post=\"1848096\" timestamp=\"1399129624\"]\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]Hi Ladies, [\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. [\/font][\/quote]\nHey! I would be interested in the information! Would you be able to forward it off to me?\n\nchantal_vaspori@hotmail.com\n\nThanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1851611,"PostDate":1400685025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pao1, on 03 May 2014 - 10:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Hi Ladies, <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey! I would be interested in the information! Would you be able to forward it off to me?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>chantal_vaspori@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chantal_vaspori@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.254.246.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400092080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsHenderson","Id":277968,"Name":"FutureMrsHenderson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.13.4.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97fd4b0eb120d953a830fe8096c351cb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Pao1\" post=\"1848096\" timestamp=\"1399129624\"]\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]Hi Ladies, [\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. [\/font][\/quote]Hi!! Can you email it to me please? GrabmillerWedding2015@[member=\"gmail\"].com? TIA!","Attachments":[],"Id":1852989,"PostDate":1401534804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pao1, on 03 May 2014 - 10:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Hi Ladies, <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi!! Can you email it to me please? GrabmillerWedding2015@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com? TIA!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather.pfannes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.185.204.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400144157,"Ph