Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":176,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903765,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1441579996","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1441001393,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1903765,"PostDate":1441001393,"PostContent":"My fianc\u00e9 and I currently have a 5 month old who was born at 28 weeks, at this time planning a bi...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1441579996","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79550,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d1c0c1dd1e397baf51ab18184d25590","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I currently have a 5 month old who was born at 28 weeks, at this time planning a big wedding at home is just too much on our plates so a destination wedding sounds great.&amp;nbsp;My fiance&amp;nbsp;wants somewhere that our son can go.&amp;nbsp;We just got the green light from the Dr. that the trip will be okay, with some precautions. &amp;nbsp;Has anyone had any issues with bringing a small child along? Any modifications they made to the wedding or reception?&amp;nbsp; Did they bring a nanny or use family to help?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have been working out the details with coordinator at Now Larmier for late May, but still open to ideas if anyone has suggestions for a resort that would be better for working with us and our small child.&amp;nbsp; Just want to get those little things sorted now so I can focus on the good stuff. =)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903765,"PostDate":1441001393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My fianc\u00e9 and I currently have a 5 month old who was born at 28 weeks, at this time planning a big wedding at home is just too much on our plates so a destination wedding sounds great.\u00a0My fiance\u00a0wants somewhere that our son can go.\u00a0We just got the green light from the Dr. that the trip will be okay, with some precautions. \u00a0Has anyone had any issues with bringing a small child along? Any modifications they made to the wedding or reception?\u00a0 Did they bring a nanny or use family to help?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have been working out the details with coordinator at Now Larmier for late May, but still open to ideas if anyone has suggestions for a resort that would be better for working with us and our small child.\u00a0 Just want to get those little things sorted now so I can focus on the good stuff. =)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1441579996","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79550,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd62171f74573ca9d4e8784ceb6d3203","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know there have been a few brides here married in the DR that had small kids present so if you do a search in the search bar up top for that resort I&#039;m sure any questions will be answered in the threads. Here are 2 of them but there was just too many to post. Do a search up top and about a dozen will come up. Spend some time reading through. They&#039;ll give you loads of info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72826-now-larimar-2014-brides\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72826-now-larimar-2014-brides\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903816,"PostDate":1441052346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know there have been a few brides here married in the DR that had small kids present so if you do a search in the search bar up top for that resort I'm sure any questions will be answered in the threads. Here are 2 of them but there was just too many to post. Do a search up top and about a dozen will come up. Spend some time reading through. They'll give you loads of info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...w-larimar-2015\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72826-now-larimar-2014-brides\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ar-2014-brides\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79550","Title":"Taking Son To Punta Cana For Our Wedding","LastPostDate":1441052346},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
