g! You had the cutest ideas!!&amp;nbsp; Looks like you had an amazing wedding!&amp;nbsp; Its so funny you said that about the dress, because I just posted on here about flying with your dress!!&amp;nbsp; I have one- question?&amp;nbsp; How did you do with the heat?&amp;nbsp; Were your guests very hot sitting in the sun during the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; How was the reception outdoors?&amp;nbsp; Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Christine&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893590,"PostDate":1429406104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282082-jnvoigt\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>jnvoigt<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much for sharing! You had the cutest ideas!!\u00a0 Looks like you had an amazing wedding!\u00a0 Its so funny you said that about the dress, because I just posted on here about flying with your dress!!\u00a0 I have one- question?\u00a0 How did you do with the heat?\u00a0 Were your guests very hot sitting in the sun during the ceremony.\u00a0 How was the reception outdoors?\u00a0 Thank you so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Christine<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388147078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.25.136.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64dcca95979dc28396a39e7cfa2a68b2","RawContent":"Hey Christine\n\nThanks and yes it was ! The heat was only bad at the ceremony  which was at 430 pm and it felt like it was beating on us. I gave everyone paper fans so they were ok but we were hot. My hubby was sweating when he walked back down the Isle with me for sure ! But as soon as we were done and could get some shade we were good. The reception was great and it didn&#039;t feel too hot at all. Some guys did change to shorts though !\n\nHope that helps and good luck with the planning !","Attachments":[],"Id":1893871,"PostDate":1429645525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Christine<br>\nThanks and yes it was ! The heat was only bad at the ceremony  which was at 430 pm and it felt like it was beating on us. I gave everyone paper fans so they were ok but we were hot. My hubby was sweating when he walked back down the Isle with me for sure ! But as soon as we were done and could get some shade we were good. The reception was great and it didn't feel too hot at all. Some guys did change to shorts though !<br>\nHope that helps and good luck with the planning !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jnvoigt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.56.187.156","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423645207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282082.jpg?_r=1428850100","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jnvoigt","Id":282082,"Name":"jnvoigt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.90.27.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a86030e1175449a81915c0f63f6a6d8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Jess-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; I couldn&#039;t open the attachments either. &amp;nbsp;Mind emailing them to me? &amp;nbsp;Becksnfx@[member=\"gmail\"].com. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m an April 2016 bride.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896662,"PostDate":1432119779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Jess-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 I couldn't open the attachments either. \u00a0Mind emailing them to me? \u00a0Becksnfx@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com. \u00a0I'm an April 2016 bride.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becksnfx@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.90.27.19","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432119628,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"becksnfx","Id":283173,"Name":"becksnfx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.63.55.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f2374e0b6c047672bf3126c35b7984a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jnvoigt\"] &amp;nbsp;Hi Jess, Congratulations!!! Thank you so much for posting this and being so detailed. I&#039;m sure we all appreciate it! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married here April 29, 2016 and have been having a ton of anxiety...reading your post has eased some of my nerves. Thank you isn&#039;t enough!! May I ask that you also email me too at itsjustmetrish@[member=\"gmail\"].com I truly appreciate it!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902379,"PostDate":1439393579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282082\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282082-jnvoigt\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jnvoigt<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Hi Jess, Congratulations!!! Thank you so much for posting this and being so detailed. I'm sure we all appreciate it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>I'm getting married here April 29, 2016 and have been having a ton of anxiety...reading your post has eased some of my nerves. Thank you isn't enough!! May I ask that you also email me too at itsjustmetrish@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com I truly appreciate it!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"itsjustmetrish@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.63.55.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439377741,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284383.jpg?_r=1439433185","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fijiangel15","Id":284383,"Name":"fijiangel15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.45.141.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a802be4c96bc429bf0daa2f644b92d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much! your review was so helpful and its helping me with my stress! One Question... was Alcohol included with dinner. This is very important for me &amp;amp; guest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903641,"PostDate":1440754365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you so much! your review was so helpful and its helping me with my stress! One Question... was Alcohol included with dinner. This is very important for me & guest.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pannelisse@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.45.141.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440602997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284576.jpg?_r=1441579996","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beJara","Id":284576,"Name":"Soon2beJara","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79050","Title":"Now Larimar Review !","LastPostDate":1440848332},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
