would start a 2016 Majestic Elegance bride forum. I&#039;m planning for my wedding to be on March 15th 2016. I&#039;m hoping to have the ceremony on the beach in the gazebo. I would really like to have a private reception but I&#039;m still looking into the costs associated. Does anyone have ideas about photographers? From what I&#039;ve read, the on-site service is not reliable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sarah&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871441,"PostDate":1410417940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought I would start a 2016 Majestic Elegance bride forum. I'm planning for my wedding to be on March 15th 2016. I'm hoping to have the ceremony on the beach in the gazebo. I would really like to have a private reception but I'm still looking into the costs associated. Does anyone have ideas about photographers? From what I've read, the on-site service is not reliable.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sarah<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahsamuelwedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.206.2.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410255450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279746.jpg?_r=1410435597","PhotoWidth":50,"PhotoHeight":50,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah835","Id":279746,"Name":"Sarah835","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78000,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7700b6898a37f7867f5eafe99a447b46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Sarah835\"] Congrats on your engagement and wedding:) I&#039;m not a Majestic bride. However, look into HDC for your wedding photos. They have amazing reviews and the photos I&#039;ve seen are beautiful. Happy planning my fellow 2016 bride!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871541,"PostDate":1410447040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279746\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279746-sarah835\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sarah835<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your engagement and wedding:) I'm not a Majestic bride. However, look into HDC for your wedding photos. They have amazing reviews and the photos I've seen are beautiful. Happy planning my fellow 2016 bride!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?ut